sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as React / API
  participant PGo as PostgreSQL (outbox)
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant LC as Legacy consumer
  participant SQL as SQL Server
  participant LR as Legacy relay
  UI->>PGo: apply optimistically + write command, one transaction
  PGo->>MQ: relay publishes (confirmed)
  MQ->>LC: command
  LC->>SQL: ONE transaction: inbox row, session markers, stored procedure
  Note over SQL: Microsoft's trigger writes history.<br/>The lab trigger writes an outbox row marked origin=new
  SQL->>LR: outbox row
  LR->>MQ: confirmation (the legacy state, with our command id)
  MQ->>UI: replaces the optimistic state and the command is closed
